# 导航规则

## 一、基础约定

- 默认使用 `go_router`
- 所有路由配置放在 `lib/routes/`
- 路由名集中维护，不直接在业务代码里写裸字符串

---

## 二、路由目录

```text
lib/routes/
├── index.dart
├── name.dart
├── router.dart
├── observers.dart
└── transitions.dart
```

---

## 三、推荐模板

### 3.1 `routes/index.dart`

```dart
library routes;

import 'package:flutter/cupertino.dart';
import 'package:flutter/material.dart';
import 'package:go_router/go_router.dart';
import 'package:your_project/pages/main/index.dart';

part 'name.dart';
part 'router.dart';
part 'observers.dart';
part 'transitions.dart';

export 'package:go_router/go_router.dart';
```

### 3.2 `routes/name.dart`

```dart
part of 'index.dart';

abstract class RouteName {
  static const main = 'main';
  static const login = 'login';
}
```

### 3.3 `routes/router.dart`

```dart
part of 'index.dart';

abstract class CustomRouter {
  static final RouteObserver<Route> observer = RouteObservers();
  static final GlobalKey<NavigatorState> navigatorKey =
      GlobalKey<NavigatorState>();

  static final GoRouter config = GoRouter(
    initialLocation: '/',
    navigatorKey: navigatorKey,
    observers: <NavigatorObserver>[observer],
    routes: <RouteBase>[
      GoRoute(
        path: '/',
        name: RouteName.main,
        pageBuilder: (context, state) => CupertinoPage<void>(
          key: state.pageKey,
          name: state.fullPath,
          child: const MainPage(),
        ),
      ),
    ],
  );
}
```

---

## 四、命名与路径规范

- 路径：语义化英文，必要时用下划线
- 路由名：集中在 `RouteName`
- 一级页面用一级路径
- 子流程尽量注册为父路由的子路由

示例：

- `/`
- `/login`
- `/plan/editor`
- `/notes/file/:id`

---

## 五、参数传递规则

### 5.1 `pathParameters`

适用于唯一标识：

```dart
context.pushNamed(
  RouteName.noteFile,
  pathParameters: <String, String>{'id': fileId},
);
```

### 5.2 `queryParameters`

适用于简单 key-value：

```dart
context.pushNamed(
  RouteName.web,
  queryParameters: <String, String>{'url': url},
);
```

### 5.3 `extra`

适用于复杂对象：

```dart
context.pushNamed(
  RouteName.planEditorCreate,
  extra: <String, dynamic>{'draftId': draftId},
);
```

---

## 六、跳转规范

- 替换主导航或主路径：优先 `goNamed`
- 打开详情或子流程：优先 `pushNamed`
- 需要等待返回值：`await context.pushNamed(...)`
- 页面返回：`context.pop(result)`

---

## 七、路由守卫

如项目需要登录态、首启态、实验态等守卫：

- 守卫逻辑集中放在 `router.dart`
- 不把登录判断散落到每个页面中
- 守卫依赖的状态优先从 `store/` 读取

---

## 八、禁止事项

- 不直接拼裸路径字符串到处跳转
- 不把路由参数藏到全局变量里
- 不在页面中自建一套局部导航规范
